── Disclaimer ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CEDARS is a research and estimation tool. Its figures are literature-based
estimates, not measured values, and are not medical, clinical, financial, or
regulatory advice. The software is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any
kind (see LICENSE, sections 7–8). Replace defaults with your own measured data
for any reporting of record.

── Privacy ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CEDARS calculations, local saves, and portable-file import/export run in the
browser. Assessment data are transmitted only when a user explicitly chooses a
configured research-contribution workflow and completes the associated review
and consent steps. Shareable links are created only on user request and are not
published or sent automatically. See the application privacy/disclosure text
for the current deployment configuration.

